  description: King Heinrich, Master of the Hunters, has created an entire army to
    help him in his quest. Eradicating his fellow Shapeshifters is still his obsession,
    some more than others; he wants to hunt Queen Jade and finally get his revenge.
  summonDesc: Nice to meet you. I hope we'll hunt for a long time together!
